<title>USA: Dave &amp; Busters Q1 profit rises.</title>
<headline>Dave &amp; Busters Q1 profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>13 Wks Ended     13 Wks Ended</p>
<p>					   May 4, 1997	May 5, 1996</p>
<p> Revenues				    $28,632	    $20,217</p>
<p>Income before provision for</p>
<p>   income taxes				3,279		2,448</p>
<p> Net income				    2,001		1,419</p>
<p> Earnings per common share		  0.28		 0.20</p>
<p> Weighted average common shares	  7,268		7,267</p>
<p>		(In thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>NOTES: Full company name is Dave &amp; Busters Inc.</p>
<p>The company said the 42 percent increase in revenues is attributable to the opening of new stores in Bethesda, Md., and Hollywood, Fla., during fiscal 1996; the opening of its latest store in Ontaria, Calif.; and increased same-store sales.</p>
</text>
